            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O na ethĩwa mũndũ mwathe akeeka ũthũku mavĩnda ĩana, na kwongeleela mĩthenya yake, ĩndĩ vate ndĩi nĩnĩsĩ kũkeethĩwa ũseo kwa ala makĩaa Ngai, ala makĩaa mbee wake: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
