        {
          "text": "Yĩla nanenganie ngoo yakwa ĩmanye ũĩ, na kwona maũndũ ala mekawa ĩũlũ wa nthĩ (nĩkwĩthĩwa ve ũla ũtaona too na metho make mũthenya kana ũtukũ), ",
